# the drums' Pattern page: the Drums button three times; KNOB 1 the lane, the white keys its steps, a black key
# held: an accent; the first edit takes Auto's pattern over (Play: Pattern); kept by the piece
listen
wait 3000
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
wait 400
expect view 16
said Pattern page, kit Tight: Lane Kick, Accent 50, Chance 100%, Play Auto
tapkey w3
wait 200
said Step 4 on
expect par105 1
expect par89 4377
key b0 down
tapkey w2
key b0 up
wait 200
said Step 3 accented
expect par94 4
spin K1 3
wait 200
said Lane Rim
tapkey w4
tapkey w12
wait 200
expect par92 4112
spin K3 -50
wait 200
expect par102 50
spin K4 -1
wait 200
expect par105 0
said Play Auto
spin K4 1
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 4
tap PLAY
wait 6000
expect store_writes >0
reboot
wait 1000
expect par105 1
expect par92 4112
expect par94 4
